OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused told police 'she's 
OL,4,Ain the freezer', trial hears           
OL,6,FWarning: This article contains         
OL,7,Fdistressing content                    
OL,9,FA man accused of murdering his friend  
OL,10,Ftold police officers "she's in the     
OL,11,Ffreezer" as he was led out of his flat 
OL,12,Fafter his arrest, a court has heard.   
OL,14,FThe trial has been told George Gordon, 
OL,15,F65, kept the dismembered body of Delia 
OL,16,FMcInerney in a chest freezer for almost
OL,17,Fthree years. He admits killing her but 
OL,18,Fhe denies murder.                      
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
